<title>GERMANY: Germany had capital account deficit in April-Buba.</title>
<headline>Germany had capital account deficit in April-Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany had a capital account deficit of 1.2 billion marks in April after a surplus of 5.5 billion marks in March, the Bundesbank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank issued the following trade and capital account data (in billion marks)</p>
<p>				     April	March</p>
<p>    Capital account	     -1.2	 5.5</p>
<p>    Current account	     2.7	  2.9</p>
<p>    Trade balance		 10.4	 9.8</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
